# The onnxruntime-node postinstall downloads CUDA EP binaries from
# github.com/microsoft/onnxruntime/releases — that repo has been REMOVED (the
# URL 404s with no GitHub redirect; verified 2026-11-18 triage: `gh api
# repos/microsoft/onnxruntime` -> 404), so every cold-cache install fails with
# a 404 and kills CI. Revisit if the project's new host ever restores the path.
# CPU binaries are bundled in the npm tarball; skip is sufficient for CI and dev.
# Mechanism (verified live under pnpm 10.33.2, 2026-11-18): pnpm forwards this
# .npmrc key to the lifecycle script as npm_config_onnxruntime_node_install_cuda
# (read at install.js:173); env ONNXRUNTIME_NODE_INSTALL_CUDA overrides for CUDA
# dev. Re-check forwarding if the repo's pnpm major moves past 10.x.
onnxruntime-node-install-cuda=skip
